From: JSBSim GNC Lab <gnc-lab@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 01:30:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add <moving_average> FCS component

A boxcar filter over the last N executions of its channel:

  <moving_average name="fcs/q-avg">
    <input> velocities/q-rad_sec </input>
    <samples> 12 </samples>
  </moving_average>

The buffer is primed with the current input on run_ic()/reset, so the
filter starts in steady state. Includes tests/TestMovingAverage.py.
